[node name="ShieldGlow" type="Node3D" parent="."]

; One fire per place a subsystem can sit: the six shield facings, plus the hull
; core behind all of them. Authored rather than spawned, because there are
; exactly seven of them and the count never changes (CLAUDE.md 5.1). A fire
; with nothing dead in its sector simply shows nothing.
;
; They are children of the rig, so they turn with the ship and a fire in the
; port quarter stays in the port quarter. Their smoke does not: see the Plume
; note in scenes/subsystem_fire.tscn.

